Define AKI as any of:
- Serum creatinine increase **≥0.3 mg/dL within 48 hours**
- Serum creatinine increase to **≥1.5× baseline within 7 days**
- Urine output **<0.5 mL/kg/hour for ≥6 hours**, if reliable urine-output data are available

