- Use actual longitudinal creatinine values to identify KDIGO AKI rather than diagnosis codes alone.
- Identify baseline creatinine and the creatinine value/time that first met KDIGO criteria.
- Include **KDIGO AKI stage 1, 2, or 3**.
- Exclude patients on **chronic maintenance dialysis before admission**; acute dialysis during the AKI hospitalization should be identified separately, not automatically excluded.
- Include patient ID, encounter ID, CKD stage, admission/discharge dates, baseline creatinine, AKI onset creatinine, peak creatinine, KDIGO stage, acute dialysis status, and discharge survival status.
- Return **one row per qualifying AKI admission**.
